unshield
------------------------------------------
Tool and library to extract CAB files from InstallShield installers

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libiconv2-1.19-2
  libssl3-3.5.9-1
  libunshield-devel-1.6.2-1bl2
  libunshield1-1.6.2-1bl2
  pkg-config-3.0.11-1
  zlib0-1.4-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.13-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libiconv-devel-1.19-2
  libssl-devel-3.5.9-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1
  zlib-devel-1.4-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/twogood/unshield

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/twogood/unshield.git

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack unshield-1.6.2-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./unshield-1.6.2-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/unshield-1.6.2-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/unshield-1.6.2-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libunshield1-1.6.2-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libunshield-devel-1.6.2-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(unshield)
  /usr/bin/unshield.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/unshield.README
  /usr/share/doc/unshield/ChangeLog
  /usr/share/doc/unshield/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/unshield/README.md
  /usr/share/man/man1/unshield.1.gz

(libunshield1)
  /usr/bin/cygunshield-1.dll

(libunshield-devel)
  /usr/include/libunshield.h
  /usr/lib/cmake/unshield/unshieldConfig-relwithdebinfo.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/unshield/unshieldConfig.cmake
  /usr/lib/libunshield.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libunshield.pc

